{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brazil: Tropical Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an unforgettable journey through the sunniest country in South America! An exciting adventure awaits you where you can examine Brazilian landmarks in minute detail, find hidden objects, and collect unique souvenirs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your route will take you through Brazil's most famous places: from the mighty Iguazu Falls to the golden beaches of Copacabana, from the mysterious Amazon jungles to the modern streets of S\u00e3o Paulo. Each location is a new story and an opportunity to learn more about the culture and nature of this amazing country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614690/extras/ea35ae404874a1e4519d9eda5daddb18.poster.avif?t=1772653550\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614690/extras/ea35ae404874a1e4519d9eda5daddb18.webm?t=1772653550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614690/extras/ea35ae404874a1e4519d9eda5daddb18.mp4?t=1772653550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collector's Edition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A special edition with additional content is available for true travel connoisseurs:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 10 new locations with Brazilian landscapes<br>\u2022 22 additional mini-games of various genres<br>\u2022 Collection of thematic desktop wallpapers<br>\u2022 Music player with national motifs<br>\u2022 Catalog of exclusive souvenirs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614690/extras/70d253b4ace1edbfa179d136eb366e4f.poster.avif?t=1772653550\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614690/extras/70d253b4ace1edbfa179d136eb366e4f.webm?t=1772653550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614690/extras/70d253b4ace1edbfa179d136eb366e4f.mp4?t=1772653550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the magic of Brazil, its rhythms and colors, and become a true expert of this amazing country!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After visiting all locations and collecting the complete souvenir collection, you'll be honored at a special award ceremony during a virtual Brazilian carnival. You'll receive the title of &quot;Honorary Traveler&quot; and get exclusive access to additional materials about Brazil.</p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2614690?t=1772653550","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2614690?t=1772653550","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614690/8334e42035726129bacc77d164d33ab2c608b850/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772653550","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614690/8334e42035726129bacc77d164d33ab2c608b850/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772653550","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brazil: Tropical Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an unfor